"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8mRgpubxHqnqvENK4Bei30xMDvy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/re3ZvlKJg04iLpLRf1xTKHS2wLU.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two years after bringing peace to the galaxy, Steven Universe sees his past come back to haunt him in the form of a deranged Gem who wants to destroy the Earth.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21481,\"title\":\"Twitches\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8ctDK5B0uR2gre2PxQSSkJZFmh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cu00bZ1hg3Zw9lfDdtMFtvqDTzF.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Twins separated at birth, Camryn and Alex meet by chance for the first time on their 21st birthday and discover they're witches with the power to save their homeland of Coventry from the evil that threatens it. But when Camryn leaves Alex to face the darkness alone, will Coventry be doomed? Or will the sisters multiply their magic by standing together?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":46169,\"title\":\"Twitches Too\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/70aurzbqFMuJnwhIVW2aXeyzBAp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/siidi1AD6JNwWqrepY5DhqCCuEX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Reunited witch twins Camryn and Alex adjust to their new life as supernatural beings while at the same time trying to maintain a normal existence in this sequel to the magical Disney Channel original movie Twitches. But they soon find themselves going head to head with the forces of darkness that threaten to destroy their world. Luckily, their birth mother, the powerful Miranda, is on hand to help out.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":363486,\"title\":\"Just in Time for Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uyaCUEil9nBQmnCtt5zGcmztLXB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rYIObbhZGLAK4rlrLDSKhc8Vrh0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lindsay is faced with a life-altering decision as Christmas approaches: Stay in her tiny hometown and marry boyfriend Jason or accept a coveted post teaching at an Ivy League college on the other side of the country. What to do? Fortunately for Lindsay, she has some big-time help in the form of a magical messenger who is able to transport her three years into the future to see how it would all turn out.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":32790,\"title\":\"The Good Witch\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nZVOeGCbhLzIfCOB7BCvIrE2TaY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6W5zmMhUO9yHuVbsYQTJnjLFQnT.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A mysterious woman comes in to town and inhabits the local haunted mansion, making everyone wonder if she's a witch or \\\"The Grey Lady\\\".\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14711,\"title\":\"Afro Samurai: Resurrection\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6snrLj3Ydmbu5L9giAYtiSNwE0U.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4rNjTccVltQHKKJd6INzqHtfV5x.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Afro Samurai avenged his father and found a life of peace. But the legendary master is forced back into the game by a beautiful and deadly woman from his past. The sparks of violence dropped along Afro’s bloody path now burn out of control – and nowhere are the flames of hatred more intense than in the eyes of Sio.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":762879,\"title\":\"Christmas...Again?!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tCE4EHfSfGJHKSBIvbSCtplElLE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mFDUO48v1Cik3MToFgBsF2Milvv.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Rowena \\\"Ro\\\" is a high-spirited 11-year-old hoping to add more spunk to her Christmas celebrations when her parents’ divorce is going anything but smoothly.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":50479,\"title\":\"Avalon High\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A0VRhkL3l7YWHH4FTWMCki55rfx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/agnO4yvC1H05nEbqonBZ5TH7EcE.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Elaine \\\"Ellie\\\" Harrison has just moved from Minnesota to Annapolis, Maryland while her parents take a year-long sabbatical to continue their medieval studies in nearby Washington D.C. Her new high school, Avalon High, seems like a typical high school with the stereotypical students: Lance the jock, Jennifer the cheerleader, Marco, the bad boy/desperado, and Will, the senior class president, quarterback, and all around good guy. But not everyone at Avalon High is who they appear to be, not even Ellie herself. Eventually, it becomes apparent that Avalon High is a situation where the ancient Arthurian legend is repeating itself.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":73108,\"title\":\"Teen Spirit\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8mmxoEBzTMX4ziYgveeEx35ltNY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s75xYQOo4Hy2fy229CEfj5jgC2B.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Amber, a mean popular girl who gets electrocuted and dies, is not allowed to enter into heaven unless she helps the least popular girl in school become Prom Queen within a week, but things do not go as planned.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":367544,\"title\":\"The Spirit of Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ynWcaW8ZrtBeuzgUyEXR30A2TAT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uwnAbCfrxDeWKqxAMas6ZnmAqfQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A woman falls in love with a man who is somewhat unavailable.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":410314,\"title\":\"A Wish for Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9z81XnaxHJ7LYptef6augvgwake.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qmp8GP9deU4wMRPxZ7LyHCX15Js.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sara Shaw is the type of woman who prefers to sit on the sidelines at work, but when her big idea for a Christmas initiative is stolen, she makes a wish to Santa that she'll finally have the courage to stand up for herself. Santa grants her wish, but only gives her 48 hours. As the clock ticks, Sara will discover how to channel the Christmas magic and speak her mind all on her own.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":332356,\"title\":\"Killing Jesus\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1Wr7apWkhqHSdzmxnQuzlKTzdK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q5CQZRXM5PBMNga9G1cErB6gOs8.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jesus of Nazareth’s life and ministry were subject to seismic social and political events that led to his execution and changed the world forever.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"VvfXvW2wsuQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"oMKoTu6GQRU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"dWmc_XRpa9U\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}